@startuml SSD_UC4_RecordConsent
title SSD - UC4 Record contributor consent
hide footbox

actor ":Production Coordinator" as PC
participant ":Production Record System" as S

PC -> S : selectContribution(contribution)
S --> PC : contributor, episode, role, agreed credit\nand earlier consent records

PC -> S : recordConsent(contribution, form, intendedUse, dateGiven, evidenceLocation)
alt all items given and form permitted (C5)
  S --> PC : consent recorded with its form, intended use,\ndate given and evidence location (GS22, GS23)
else form not paper, email or verbal at the start of a recording
  S --> PC : consent not recorded: form not permitted (C5)
else intended use, date given or evidence location missing
  S --> PC : consent not recorded: missing item requested (FR5)
end

note right of S
  dateGiven = the date the contributor gave
  consent, not the date staff enter it (GS23).
  One consent covers all drafts and channels
  of the episode until Q3 is answered (A15).
  Scenarios: GS22, GS23, GS24
end note
@enduml
